    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RPM Property are delighted to introduce to the market this three-bedroom terraced home, ideally located in a mature residential estate in the village of Shanagolden. just approximately 16 mins (16km) from Newcastle West and approx 5 mins (5km) to Foynes \n\nThe property measures 80.36 (m2)/ 864sq.ft and constructed in 1986.\n\nThe property is located within easy reach of local shops, restaurant, service station, school and public transport where there is regular bus services providing convenient access to Newcastle West, Foynes, Limerick and surrounding areas.\n\nAccommodation consists of main reception room, open plan kitchen dining room, three bedrooms and main bathroom. \n\nTo the rear there is a private garden with block built shed/workshop with side walkway access. \n\nThis property is ideally located for those either wishing to hop onto the property ladder downsizing or just wanting to move to a beautiful location. \n\nViewing is highly recommended and strictly by appointment only with the sole agent Resource Property Management\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Notice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
